---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Get in Touch"
  description="Contact K Scott Davidson — Deep North research, speaking, and consulting."
>

  <section style="padding: 7rem 1.5rem 6rem;">
    <div class="prose-container">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin: 0 0 2rem;">Contact</p>

      <h1 style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; color: #1A1A1A; margin: 0 0 2.5rem;">
        Get in Touch
      </h1>

      <div class="body-prose">
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #1A1A1A;">
          I'd welcome hearing from you — whether you're interested in the work, exploring a
          speaking or consulting engagement, or just want to think out loud about something
          this sparked.
        </p>

        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #1A1A1A;">
          The best way to reach me is email:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 2rem 0 3rem; padding: 1.75rem; background-color: #F0EDE6; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;">
        <a
          href="mailto:ken@deepnorth.com.au"
          style="font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.25rem; color: #2A7F6F; text-decoration: none;"
        >
          ken@deepnorth.com.au
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="body-prose">
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #1A1A1A;">
          If you want to follow the ongoing work, subscribe to the Deep North Substack
          where I write regularly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;">
        <a
          href="https://kscottdavidson.substack.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="arrow-link"
          style="font-size: 1rem;"
        >
          Deep North on Substack &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #888;">
        I'm based in Far North Queensland, Australia, and available for conversations across time zones.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
